From f24ea754ce465ee50b712d33bdb4377e6deb85b1 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Fri, 6 Nov 2026 02:56:43 +0100
Subject: [PATCH] nx2: a physical core each for the GPU front and back; OoT PGO
 workflow flavor

EDEN_NX2_PLACEMENT puts the split's front and back on a physical core each (both SMT
siblings) inside the GPU L3 domain and VulkanWorker on the domain's other cores, so a front
spinning on the back never shares its core (EDEN_NX2_PLACEMENT_CORES=0: shared domain).

lichii-tuned gains a pgogen flavor (instrumented build) and merges .profraw files committed
under pgo/ into the profile of the normal and lto flavors.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01HmEAGe4MCAJnHoeqq7Uysk
